=\"28\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"28\" data-file-height=\"23\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Ranged\" title=\"Ranged\">Ranged defence</a></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"24\" class=\"infobox-padding\"></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"8\" class=\"infobox-nested\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Ranged_weapons#Light\" title=\"Light\"><img alt=\"Light\" src=\"/images/Steel_dart.png?3203e\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"29\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"29\" /></a></span></th><th colspan=\"8\" class=\"infobox-nested\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Ranged_weapons#Standard\" title=\"Standard\"><img alt=\"Standard\" src=\"/images/Steel_arrow_5.png?2c4a2\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"31\" data-file-height=\"30\" /></a></span></th><th colspan=\"8\" class=\"infobox-nested\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Ranged_weapons#Heavy\" title=\"Heavy\"><img alt=\"Heavy\" src=\"/images/Steel_bolts_5.png?f1c11\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"28\" height=\"29\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"28\" data-file-height=\"29\" /></a></span></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"8\" class=\"infobox-nested\">+0</td><td colspan=\"8\" class=\"infobox-nested\">+0</td><td colspan=\"8\" class=\"infobox-nested\">+0</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"24\" class=\"infobox-padding\"></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"24\" class=\"infobox-subheader\">Immunities</th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"24\" class=\"infobox-padding\"></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"8\"><a href=\"/w/Poison\" title=\"Poison\">Poison</a></th><td colspan=\"16\">Immune</td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"8\"><a href=\"/w/Venom\" title=\"Venom\">Venom</a></th><td colspan=\"16\">Immune</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"24\" class=\"infobox-padding\"></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"24\" class=\"dps-calc-button infobox-full-width-content\"><div class=\"dps-calc plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://tools.runescape.wiki/osrs-dps/?monster=3477\"><span class=\"mw-ui-button dps-calc-openbtn mw-ui-progressive\" style=\"min-height:0; margin-bottom: 8px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"/images/thumb/Dps_calc_logo.png/32px-Dps_calc_logo.png?bdd0d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"31\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Dps_calc_logo.png/64px-Dps_calc_logo.png?bdd0d 2x\" data-file-width=\"1221\" data-file-height=\"1191\" /></span></span> Open in DPS calculator</span></a></div></td></tr><tr class=\"advanced-data\"><th colspan=\"24\" class=\"infobox-subheader\">Advanced data</th></tr><tr class=\"advanced-data\"><td colspan=\"24\" class=\"infobox-padding\"></td></tr><tr class=\"advanced-data\"><th colspan=\"8\">Monster ID</th><td colspan=\"16\">3477</td></tr><tr class=\"advanced-data\"><th colspan=\"8\">Link</th><td colspan=\"16\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://chisel.weirdgloop.org/moid/npc_id.html#3477\">MOID</a></td></tr><tr class=\"advanced-data\"><td colspan=\"24\" class=\"infobox-padding\"></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"infobox-smw-data navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><b>A Doubt</b> is a <a href=\"/w/Monster\" title=\"Monster\">monster</a> fought during the <a href=\"/w/Dream_Mentor\" title=\"Dream Mentor\">Dream Mentor</a> <a href=\"/w/Quest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Quest\">quest</a> in the <a href=\"/w/Dream_World\" title=\"Dream World\">Dream World</a>. Many Doubts are summoned during the first battle by <a href=\"/w/The_Inadequacy\" title=\"The Inadequacy\">The Inadequacy</a>. They represent <a href=\"/w/Cyrisus\" title=\"Cyrisus\">Cyrisus</a>, the protagonist, and his little nagging doubts about combat. Though they can be fought and killed easily, they disappear once the player defeats The Inadequacy.\n</p><p>It is recommended to turn off <a href=\"/w/Auto-retaliate\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Auto-retaliate\">auto-retaliate</a> to avoid attacking Doubts, and avoid attacking them at all unless using <a href=\"/w/Blood_spells\" title=\"Blood spells\">blood spells</a> to heal.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Location\">Location</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/A_Doubt?section=1&amp;veaction=edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" title=\"Edit section: Location\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/A_Doubt?action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Location\">edit source</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a class=\"mw-kartographer-map mw-kartographer-container floatleft\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 300px;background-image: url(https://maps.runescape.wiki/osrs/versions/2025-04-16_a/tiles/rendered/-1/2/2_27_81.png), url(https://maps.runescape.wiki/osrs/versions/2025-04-16_a/tiles/rendered/-1/2/2_28_81.png), url(https://maps.runescape.wiki/osrs/versions/2025-04-16_a/tiles/rendered/-1/2/2_29_81.png), url(https://maps.runescape.wiki/osrs/versions/2025-04-16_a/tiles/rendered/-1/2/2_27_80.png), url(https://maps.runescape.wiki/osrs/versions/2025-04-16_a/tiles/rendered/-1/2/2_28_80.png), url(https://maps.runescape.wiki/osrs/versions/2025-04-16_a/tiles/rendered/-1/2/2_29_80.png), url(https://maps.runescape.wiki/osrs/versions/2025-04-16_a/tiles/rendered/-1/2/2_27_79.png), url(https://maps.runescape.wiki/osrs/versions/2025-04-16_a/tiles/rendered/-1/2/2_28_79.png), url(https://maps.runescape.wiki/osrs/versions/2025-04-16_a/tiles/rendered/-1/2/2_29_79.png); background-position: -234px -242px, 22px -242px, 278px -242px, -234px 14px, 22px 14px, 278px 14px, -234px 270px, 22px 270px, 278px 270px; background-repeat